{"seq":3,"slug":"joins-aggregations","title":"流式连接与聚合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/stream-processing-realtime/operators/joins-aggregations","wordCount":1273,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"流式连接与聚合\">流式连接与聚合</h1><p>把两条流「连接」起来，听上去和数据库里的 <code>JOIN</code> 没什么两样。但设想这个场景：一条流是「用户点击广告」，另一条流是「用户完成购买」，你想算出「点击后多久内发生了购买」。点击和购买可能相隔几秒，也可能相隔几小时，而两条流都是无界的——你不可能把一条流全读进内存再去匹配另一条。流上的连接与聚合，因为「无界」和「时间」这两个约束，长出了和批处理截然不同的形态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-连接与聚合的流式挑战\">核心概念：连接与聚合的流式挑战</h2><p>在批处理里，连接和聚合都假设能看到全量数据。流处理打破这个假设，于是两类操作都要面对同一个根本矛盾：<strong>结果需要等待未来的数据，但流永不结束</strong>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>流式聚合</strong>：像「累计每个用户的总消费」，结果随每条新事件而变化，是一个持续更新的值，而非一次算定的终值。</li>\n<li><strong>流式连接</strong>：两条无界流的匹配必须有边界（通常是时间边界），否则状态会无限增长直到耗尽资源。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[流 A: 点击事件] --&gt; C[流式连接算子]&#10;  B[流 B: 购买事件] --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt; D{时间边界内匹配?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[输出连接结果]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F[暂存状态等待&lt;br/&gt;或超时丢弃]&#10;  F -.状态有界化.-&gt; C\">flowchart TD\n  A[流 A: 点击事件] --&gt; C[流式连接算子]\n  B[流 B: 购买事件] --&gt; C\n  C --&gt; D{时间边界内匹配?}\n  D --&gt;|是| E[输出连接结果]\n  D --&gt;|否| F[暂存状态等待&lt;br/&gt;或超时丢弃]\n  F -.状态有界化.-&gt; C</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>批处理</th>\n<th>流处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>聚合结果</td>\n<td>一次算定</td>\n<td>持续增量更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连接数据范围</td>\n<td>全量</td>\n<td>受时间窗口/状态约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态增长</td>\n<td>无（任务结束即释放）</td>\n<td>须主动设界，否则无限膨胀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间维度</td>\n<td>无关</td>\n<td>核心约束</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"增量聚合-避免重算\">增量聚合：避免重算</h2><p>流式聚合的关键技巧是<strong>增量</strong>：不要每来一条事件就把窗口里所有事件重算一遍，而是只用新事件更新一个累加器。对于「求和」「计数」「最大值」这类可结合的聚合，每条事件只需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 地并入累加器：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>sum</mtext><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>sum</mtext><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{sum}_{n} = \\text{sum}_{n-1} + x_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sum</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sum</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// Flink: 增量聚合，累加器只保存当前总和，不保存全部事件&#10;stream.keyBy(Order::getUserId)&#10;      .window(TumblingEventTimeWindows.of(Time.hours(1)))&#10;      .aggregate(new AggregateFunction&lt;Order, Long, Long&gt;() {&#10;          public Long createAccumulator() { return 0L; }&#10;          public Long add(Order o, Long acc) { return acc + o.getAmount(); }&#10;          public Long getResult(Long acc) { return acc; }&#10;          public Long merge(Long a, Long b) { return a + b; }&#10;      });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Flink: 增量聚合，累加器只保存当前总和，不保存全部事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stream.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">keyBy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">getUserId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">window</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(TumblingEventTimeWindows.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hours</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">aggregate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AggregateFunction&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Long </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createAccumulator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0L</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Long </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Order </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, Long </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">acc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> acc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> o.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getAmount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Long </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Long </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">acc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> acc; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Long </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">merge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Long </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, Long </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      });</span></span></code></pre></div><p>增量聚合把窗口的状态从「保存所有原始事件」压缩成「保存一个累加器」，状态大小从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，这对长窗口、大流量的场景至关重要。并非所有聚合都能增量化——中位数、精确去重计数这类「整体性」聚合就需要近似算法（如 HyperLogLog 估算基数）来控制状态。这些聚合产生的累加器正是要被检查点保护的状态（见 <a href=\"../state-fault/state-management\">状态管理与状态后端</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"窗口连接-用时间设界\">窗口连接：用时间设界</h2><p>最直接的流连接方式是<strong>窗口连接</strong>（window join）：先把两条流都切成相同的窗口（见 <a href=\"windowing\">窗口：滚动、滑动与会话</a>），只在同一个窗口内做匹配。这样每条事件只需和「同窗口的对方事件」配对，状态自然有界——窗口结束即可释放。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 在 5 秒滚动窗口内连接点击流与曝光流&#10;clickStream.join(impressionStream)&#10;    .where(Click::getAdId)&#10;    .equalTo(Impression::getAdId)&#10;    .window(TumblingEventTimeWindows.of(Time.seconds(5)))&#10;    .apply((click, imp) -&gt; new JoinedEvent(click, imp));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 在 5 秒滚动窗口内连接点击流与曝光流</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">clickStream.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(impressionStream)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">where</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Click</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">getAdId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">equalTo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Impression</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">getAdId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">window</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(TumblingEventTimeWindows.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">seconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">apply</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((click, imp) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> JoinedEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(click, imp));</span></span></code></pre></div><p>窗口连接的局限是「硬边界」：如果一个点击在窗口末尾、对应购买恰好落到下一个窗口，它们就匹配不上。这个边界效应让窗口连接对「精确配对」的场景不够友好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"间隔连接-相对时间窗\">间隔连接：相对时间窗</h2><p>为了缓解硬边界问题，<strong>间隔连接</strong>（interval join）改用「相对时间」匹配：流 A 的一条事件 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>，去匹配流 B 中事件时间落在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mtext>lowerBound</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mtext>upperBound</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[a.ts + \\text{lowerBound},\\ a.ts + \\text{upperBound}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lowerBound</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">upperBound</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 区间内的事件。每条事件携带自己的、滑动的匹配窗口，不再受固定窗口边界切割。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 购买事件去匹配「此前 10 分钟到此后 0 秒」内的点击事件&#10;purchaseStream.keyBy(Purchase::getUserId)&#10;    .intervalJoin(clickStream.keyBy(Click::getUserId))&#10;    .between(Time.minutes(-10), Time.seconds(0))&#10;    .process(new AttributionFunction());\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 购买事件去匹配「此前 10 分钟到此后 0 秒」内的点击事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">purchaseStream.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">keyBy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Purchase</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">getUserId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">intervalJoin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(clickStream.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">keyBy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Click</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">getUserId))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">between</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">minutes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), Time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">seconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AttributionFunction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span></code></pre></div><p>间隔连接特别适合归因分析、行为关联这类「A 之后一段时间内是否发生 B」的需求。它的状态以匹配区间的跨度为界，水位线推进时清理过期事件。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[购买事件 ts=T] --&gt; B[计算匹配区间&lt;br/&gt;T-10min 到 T]&#10;  B --&gt; C[在区间内查找点击事件]&#10;  C --&gt; D[匹配成功 输出归因结果]&#10;  E[水位线推进] --&gt; F[清理超出区间的旧事件]\">graph TD\n  A[购买事件 ts=T] --&gt; B[计算匹配区间&lt;br/&gt;T-10min 到 T]\n  B --&gt; C[在区间内查找点击事件]\n  C --&gt; D[匹配成功 输出归因结果]\n  E[水位线推进] --&gt; F[清理超出区间的旧事件]</pre><h2 id=\"时态表连接-流与维表\">时态表连接：流与维表</h2><p>还有一类极常见的需求：用一条事实流去关联一份「会随时间变化的维度数据」，比如「用订单流关联下单那一刻的汇率表」。如果维度数据也是一条变更流，这就是<strong>时态表连接</strong>（temporal join）——连接时取「事实事件发生时刻」对应的维度版本，而非维度的最新值。这保证了历史正确性：三天前的订单用三天前的汇率，而非今天的汇率。</p>\n<p>时态表连接需要维护维度表的多版本状态，并用事件时间去查询「截至该时刻的最新版本」。它是流式 SQL 里极其重要的连接类型，会在 <a href=\"../engines/stream-sql\">流式 SQL</a> 中以声明式语法再次出现，那里能更清楚地看到它的威力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>流式连接与聚合的根本约束是「<strong>无界</strong> + <strong>时间</strong>」：结果要等未来数据，状态必须主动设界。</li>\n<li><strong>增量聚合</strong>只更新累加器，把状态从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；整体性聚合需近似算法控状态。</li>\n<li><strong>窗口连接</strong>用相同窗口设界（有硬边界问题）、<strong>间隔连接</strong>用相对时间区间（适合归因）、<strong>时态表连接</strong>取事件时刻的维度版本（保证历史正确性）。</li>\n<li>这些操作产生的状态由 <a href=\"../state-fault/state-management\">状态后端</a> 持久化、由 <a href=\"../state-fault/checkpointing-recovery\">检查点</a> 保护。</li>\n<li>连接与聚合在 <a href=\"../engines/stream-sql\">流式 SQL</a> 里有更简洁的声明式表达。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"流式连接与聚合","id":"流式连接与聚合"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：连接与聚合的流式挑战","id":"核心概念-连接与聚合的流式挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"增量聚合：避免重算","id":"增量聚合-避免重算"},{"level":2,"text":"窗口连接：用时间设界","id":"窗口连接-用时间设界"},{"level":2,"text":"间隔连接：相对时间窗","id":"间隔连接-相对时间窗"},{"level":2,"text":"时态表连接：流与维表","id":"时态表连接-流与维表"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"窗口：滚动、滑动与会话","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/stream-processing-realtime/operators/windowing"},"next":{"title":"状态管理与状态后端","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/stream-processing-realtime/state-fault/state-management"}}